WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.167
-Here's how it works.

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:03.669
In front of us are two envelopes
containing confessions.

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:06.706
One confession is true.
The other is a lie.

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:08.107
Once you read your confession,

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:11.077
the other two players have
60 seconds to interrogate you,

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.412
and then they have to guess

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:14.213
if you've been lying
or telling the truth.

00:00:14.213 --> 00:00:15.415
Matthew will go first.

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:17.917
Tariq, which envelope
should Matthew open?

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:20.320
-I'm going to say --
The bottom, please.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.088
-Number two.
-Yep. Number two.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.556
-Number two says...
-Here we go.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.325
-Ooh-hoy!

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:27.126
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:30.697 line:0%
I, McConaughey,
got charged by a mountain ram

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.498 line:0%
at edge of the Grand Canyon

00:00:32.498 --> 00:00:35.134 line:0%
and had to throw
my 6-month-old child

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:40.507 line:0%
15 feet through the air
to my wife to save him."

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:44.843 line:0%
-Well, I don't know.
Now the grilling begins.

00:00:44.843 --> 00:00:46.279 line:0%
-Hurry up.
-What year was it?!

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:47.814 line:0%
-This was my 40th birthday.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:50.717 line:0%
-Yeah, well, that's interesting.
16 months. Do the math there.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:51.884 line:0%
I don't know
how old your kid is.

00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:53.419 line:0%
But, uh, wait.
At the Grand Canyon.

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:56.956 line:0%
Was the Airstream there?
-Yes, it was.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.092 line:0%
2004. The one in the picture
you just saw.

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:01.260 line:0%
-So you threw the baby
to your wife?

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.628 line:0%
-Yes. I threw --
-Who was --

00:01:02.628 --> 00:01:05.264 line:0%
-Who had scattered down
along the edge

00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:07.333 line:0%
when the ram had me here
with about a 20-foot drop.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.602 line:0%
-A ram.
-And I had to --

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.571 line:0%
After I had already
got rid of the dog,

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:14.174 line:0%
I had to launch Levi
through the air for my wife

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:17.177 line:0%
to catch so we didn't
get rammed off the edge.

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:20.313 line:0%
-So you saved the dog first?
-Well, the dog --

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.048 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:24.450 line:0%
It was like those masks
in the airplane.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:25.751 line:0%
-Okay. Okay.

00:01:25.751 --> 00:01:29.289 line:0%
-So, the dog was the one
that was pissing the ram off.

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:30.924 line:0%
The dog's the one
that starts growling first.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:33.259 line:0%
So I'm like, "B.J., unh-unh."
I had to get rid of the dog.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.361 line:0%
-Was this like a baby ram,
or like a full-on...?

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:38.598 line:0%
-No, this was the "alpha."

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:39.832 line:0%
-Mm. Mm.
-Yeah.

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:42.168 line:0%
I'll tell you how, in a minute,
I knew that.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.536 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:45.772 line:0%
-It's not a "Deliverance" story.

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:49.241 line:0%
-I think he just --
I think you gave it away.

00:01:49.241 --> 00:01:52.946 line:0%
There's no -- It has to be true.
-What?! I say it's a lie.

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.113 line:0%
