00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:04.430
-I think number --.
Number one.

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:06.498
-Uno.
-Okay.

00:06:06.498 --> 00:06:08.601
-I can break you. I can know
if you're telling the truth.

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:10.602
I hang with him all the time.

00:06:10.602 --> 00:06:12.872
Oh, he had it
the backwards way, yeah.

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:15.675 line:0%
