00:06:44.303 --> 00:06:45.671 line:0%
I guess I -- I don't know.

00:06:45.671 --> 00:06:47.339 line:0%
-Whose idea was it
to go in the trunk?

00:06:47.339 --> 00:06:48.507 line:0%
-It was his.
